<title>UK: Full text of LVMH's response to GrandMet statement.</title>
<headline>Full text of LVMH's response to GrandMet statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following statement is the full text of French LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton response to the statement issued by Britain's Grand Metropolitan and Guinness slamming LVMH's demerger proposal.</p>
<p>The statement was read to Reuters by an LVMH spokesman in London.</p>
<p>&quot;This is simply a padded assembly of their releases to date and as such adds nothing of value to the situation.</p>
<p>&quot;The GMG merger proposal was cobbled together in a matter of days and is a short-term, incomplete solution to both companies' lacklustre performance.</p>
<p>&quot;LVMH's proposal of a three-way merger of the wines and spirits business adds demonstrably greater value for all shareholders than the original GMG proposal.&quot;</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
